      <string id="RealVNC_vncviewer_Machine_ServerCutText_help">Transfer the remote device's clipboard text to this device's clipboard so that it can be pasted into local applications, if supported.

The default value for this parameter is true.

If you enable this policy setting, the corresponding parameter will be set to TRUE.

If you disable this policy setting, the corresponding parameter will be set to FALSE.

