      <string id="RealVNC_vncviewer_User_SendSpecialKeys_help">Send the following keys and key combinations to the remote device: Windows, PrtScn, Alt+Tab, Alt+Esc, Ctrl+Esc. PrtScn is only sent if SendPrintScreenKey is also True

