      <string id="RealVNC_vncviewer_Machine_MaxServersToList_help">Maximum number of devices to list in a team, or 0 to use the default value set by RealVNC services.

The default value for this parameter is "0".

If you enable this policy setting, the corresponding parameter will be set to the value you specify.

If you disable this policy setting or do not configure it, the corresponding parameter will use the default or user-specified value.</string>
      <string id="RealVNC_vncviewer_Machine_Shared_help">Share the remote device's desktop with other connected users, if supported.

