If you do not configure this policy setting, the corresponding parameter will use the default or user-specified value.</string>
      <string id="RealVNC_vncviewer_Machine_SelectDesktop_help">The name of the computer to automatically switch to on connection to a suitably-enabled KVM-over-IP switch.

