      <string id="RealVNC_vncviewer_User_KeepAliveInterval_help">The number of seconds between "keep alive" messages sent to maintain a (perhaps minimized or view-only) connection that might otherwise be considered idle and terminated by routers or gateways, or 0 to not send these messages.

