      <string id="RealVNC_vncviewer_Machine_ColorLevel_help">If Quality is set to Custom, or if low quality is used, choose to display the remote device's desktop using 8 colors (rgb111), 64 colors (rgb222), 256 colors (pal8), or in full color (full).

