      <string id="RealVNC_vncviewer_Machine_ServerClipboardGraceTime_help">A number of milliseconds to wait before discarding clipboard text from the remote device if the application window no longer has focus.

The default value for this parameter is "1000".

If you enable this policy setting, the corresponding parameter will be set to the value you specify.

If you disable this policy setting or do not configure it, the corresponding parameter will use the default or user-specified value.</string>
      <string id="RealVNC_vncviewer_User_AllowCloudRelay_help">Allow cloud connections to relay data via RealVNC services, when peer-to-peer connectivity is not possible (cloud connections are end-to-end encrypted, and the keys never leave your device, so RealVNC is never able to read relayed data).

The default value for this parameter is true.

If you enable this policy setting, the corresponding parameter will be set to TRUE.

If you disable this policy setting, the corresponding parameter will be set to FALSE.

If you do not configure this policy setting, the corresponding parameter will use the default or user-specified value.</string>
