      <string id="RealVNC_vncviewer_Machine_HideCloseAlert_help">Close the application window without alerting the user if the connection is terminated unexpectedly.

The default value for this parameter is false.

If you enable this policy setting, the corresponding parameter will be set to TRUE.

If you disable this policy setting, the corresponding parameter will be set to FALSE.

